  "notes": [
    "Property set live-verified identical on PFC3D 6.00, 7.00 and 9.7 (CamelCase spellings bm_A/bm_E/bm_Estr/bm_Iy/bm_Iz/bm_J/bm_Yaxis/bm_Ydir/bm_bhGiven verbatim)."
