  "source": "Itasca UDM library: Potyondy (2019), Beam Contact Model [version 1], Technical Memorandum 2-3558-01:17TM07 (https://itasca-software.s3.amazonaws.com/udm-library/BeamContactModel.pdf); property set live-enumerated on PFC3D 6.00/7.00/9.7"
